{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "4ee866dfd66453159691915d8473aa6bd5d773653e038abb185347c6558a1f8a", "ja": "舞台袖にて　～声援の力～", "zh": "在侧台　～加油声的力量～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "87def66d44ca6abfc97566b835716dbe0616ff6d60fab85996b69676fed54cba", "ja": "待機中、亜利沙は舞台袖から熱烈なコールを\n送る。律子、苦笑。野外ステージならではの\n開放感、空気の震えを感じて、のり子と\nエレナのテンションも高い。やがて一同は、\n最高のステージへと向かって駆けていった。", "zh": "候场时，亚利沙在侧舞台送上热烈的呼喊。\n律子苦笑。感受着户外舞台特有的\n开放感与空气的震颤，法子和\n艾莲娜的情绪也格外高涨。不久后，大家便\n奔向了最棒的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "9037bfdf809511ad8e945c9c2cfe082b7a28c82ebd6c932bdfb10eedd15c09c9", "ja": "こっち見てー！　かわいいー！\nL・O・V・E、アイドルちゃんっ！　ふおおおお！", "zh": "看这边——！好可爱——！\nL・O・V・E，偶像小可爱！呜哦哦哦哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "cf19a6838b78a9b899481df74f1c4809ee0efd350457eede5b6ce6d7353a7455", "ja": "みんなのステージ、ここからだとよく見えるよネ！\nでも……アリサは、なにしてるノ？", "zh": "从这里能清楚地看到大家的舞台呢！\n不过……亚利沙在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "b425032121ae64f749039c4516a0e959cbef8e968bc063992f5a5265606c6540", "ja": "もちろん、アイドルちゃんへの応援です！\nライブと言えば、これは絶対に欠かせませんからね♪", "zh": "当然是给偶像小天使们应援啦！\n说到演唱会，这可是绝对少不了的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "0fad1c6de51b6434cac28c12b95449338630612ac12db7b9ab36846dc5a725a8", "ja": "だからって、舞台袖でやらないの！\n本当にこっち見たらどうするのよ、まったく。", "zh": "话虽如此，也别在舞台侧面做啊！\n要是真的被她看到了，你打算怎么办，真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "0d5f20285f89bc4134e0e821f30cd1ba1d42fc3fee857f518951be4b668f454b", "ja": "あははっ。まあ、テンション上がっちゃうのは\nわかるけど。いつもと違って、開放感もすごいし！", "zh": "啊哈哈。不过，嗨起来的心情\n我也挺理解的。和平时不一样，开放感也超棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "4332e6f6d1373c3656af201d73aee42f8d75dc0be33a3b1373e1a3a727d8d549", "ja": "そうそう、会場が外だもんネ♪\n屋根もないし、空も高いし、風も気持ちいいヨー！", "zh": "对呀对呀，会场是在室外嘛♪  \n没有屋顶，天空也显得特别高，风吹起来也好舒服哟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "2a54309112cf0401f02295fa4a217fd83d2ab1677969acc9be80ecdf42903f82", "ja": "それに、みんなの歓声もすごいよね！\nここにいても、もう空気の震えまで感じるもん！", "zh": "而且，大家的欢呼声也很惊人呢！  \n就算待在这里，都已经能感受到空气的震动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "9b30838743af2ba26678cd84227fca6b897849ac80bb40d05394a8406dfc1974", "ja": "そうだネっ。みんなの声と一緒なら、このまま\nずーっと、朝までダンスできそうだヨ～♪", "zh": "没错呢！和大家的声音一起的话，感觉就能这样一直跳舞跳到早上了哟～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "e3fea16344096a5439de9759dd36467b9f39a236612e87c20337808df797b7ef", "ja": "その時は、ありさも朝までコールしてみせます！\nはい！　はい！", "zh": "到那时候，亚利沙也会一直喊到早上的！\n好！好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "d367198d8b8fa392fea9321420583b0e91fe8d731f9c1089f0aa4cd01adc4c32", "ja": "だからコールはやめなさいっ。ま、この歓声なら\n大丈夫だと思うけど。……さあ、そろそろ出番よ！", "zh": "所以别再喊了！不过，有这样的欢呼声，应该没问题吧。……好了，差不多该上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "3be4bed580d7c9bd92904bd7aceac350b81eabe2731e4eae00a063a2ccf6fd99", "ja": "ありさ、いつでもいけますよ！\nコールで声出しもバッチリです♪", "zh": "亚利沙随时都可以上场哦！\n用喊声热身也十分完美♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "064685669eacfff8eca02e92797678e26415f9f4641075fc8d154cf2bf791953", "ja": "ワタシもオッケーだヨ～！　もう最初からずーっと、\nステージに飛び出したくてウズウズしてたノ♪", "zh": "我也没问题哟～！从一开始就一直按捺不住，特别想冲上舞台呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "842878437d573b00809eca9a83d6f3d06a469bf5a8c82562752ca1e387e85f96", "ja": "アタシだって！　ゴングが鳴ったら、\nすぐにでも飛び出していけるよ！", "zh": "我也是！铃声一响，我马上就能冲出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_03_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "2bc006357b6c1042a5f79e79f45d47c24312632283c6064b0d53c0e93b25502e", "ja": "頼もしい後輩たちだこと……ふふっ♪\nそれじゃ、行きましょうか！　最高のステージへ！", "zh": "真是些可靠的后辈呢……呵呵♪\n那么，我们出发吧！前往最棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
